@flexiarg buffer-cleaner/keep
@title Keep
@keywords preserve, eligibility, hard-preservation, named-buffers
@audience adapter
@tone normative
@style pattern
@grade technique
@references [buffer-cleaner/classify-staleness]
@provenance v3 diagram chip 4. Hard preservation rules are enforced in classify (by name and by raw flags): *scratch*, *Minibuf-*, *Arxana Browser*; visible, has-process, modified (any Emacs-truthy value incl. :autosaved), active-agent, server-clients.

! conclusion:
  Kept buffers are recorded with their reason; keep costs nothing in G,
  the carrying cost is fuel-side.

  + BECAUSE: what the score does not see, the record still must.
